\fs28 \cf6 \cb3 \strokec6 Submissions are evaluated according to the Mean Average Precision @ 5 (MAP@5): Submission File For every user, you must predict (strictly) 5 space-delimited **tv\\_show\\_id**s they prefer. Order matters! From the most preferred (#1) to the least preferred (#5). The file should contain a header and have the following format: user\\_id,tv\\_show\\_id 5201886213552257351,0 0 0 0 0 8646014723560466568,0 0 0 0 0 etc...\
